      "entities": {},
      "text": ": 「我喜欢你，芙莉莲。」\n「我喜欢你，芙莉莲。」\n「我知道，你已经说过的。」\n「但我是认真的说的。」\n「知道了。」\n    \n于是\n    \n骑士将玫瑰藏于身后，\n一生演绎“朋友”的深重。\nThe knight hides the rose behind him,\nLiving a lifetime playing the role of \"friend.\"\n    \n曾以为爱需反复确认，\n回响才敢让心归位。\nI once thought love needed constant reassurance,\nOnly with an echo could the heart find its place.\n    \n王座前，我忽然明白，\n最深的告白，早已埋藏星尘里。\nBefore the throne, I suddenly understand,\nThe deepest confession had long been hidden in the stardust."
